<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Settings | ActiveHub</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css"
        integrity="sha384-ggOyR0iXCbMQv3Xipma34MD+dH/1fQ784/j6cY/iJTQUOhcWr7x9JvoRxT2MZw1T" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <%- include('partials/accessibility-styles') %>
    <style>
        .settings-admin main .form-control { max-width: none; }
        .settings-field-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem 1rem; }
        .settings-field-actions > .form-control { flex: 1 1 16rem; width: auto; min-width: 0; }
        .settings-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }
        .settings-actions[hidden] { display: none; }
        .settings-value-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
        .settings-current-value { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
        .settings-value-row > button { flex-shrink: 0; }
        .settings-value-row:has(+ [data-edit-panel]:not([hidden])) { display: none; }
        @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
            .settings-field-actions > .form-control { flex-basis: 100%; width: 100%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-light settings-admin">
    <%- include('partials/navigation') %>
    <main class="container py-5">
        <header class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-4">
            <div>
                <p class="text-uppercase text-muted small mb-1">ActiveHub</p>
                <h1 class="h2 mb-1">Settings</h1>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Configure the site, booking credits and refunds</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <% if (saved) { %><output class="alert alert-success" aria-live="polite">Settings saved.</output><% } %>
        <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">The title is required and must be <%= maxLength %> characters or fewer.</div><% } %>
        <% if (organisationError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter an organisation name of <%= maxLength %> characters or fewer.</div><% } %>
        <% if (locals.membershipError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a membership scheme name of <%= maxLength %> characters or fewer.</div><% } %>
        <% if (windowSaved) { %><output class="alert alert-success" aria-live="polite">Credit request period saved.</output><% } %>
        <% if (windowError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a whole number of days from 1 to 365.</div><% } %>
        <% if (lifetimeError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a whole number of days from 1 to 36500.</div><% } %>

        <div class="admin-save-feedback mb-4">
            <p class="alert text-muted mb-0" data-admin-save-placeholder>Edit a setting directly. Save or Cancel appears when its value changes; each setting is saved separately.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="mb-4 d-flex flex-wrap" style="gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;" aria-label="Settings sections">
            <a href="#site-identity-heading">Site identity</a>
            <a href="#membership-scheme-heading">Membership</a>
            <a href="#booking-search-settings-heading">Booking search</a>
            <a href="#credit-request-settings-heading">Credits and refunds</a>
        </nav>

        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-4 mb-4" aria-labelledby="site-identity-heading">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3" id="site-identity-heading">Site identity</h2>
        <div class="admin-form-section" data-settings-item>
            <h3 class="h6" id="site-title-heading">Site title</h3>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings" data-editor-label="Site title" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="site_title">Title shown at the top of the home page</label>
                    <div class="settings-field-actions">
                        <input class="form-control" id="site_title" name="site_title" type="text" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" required value="<%= siteTitle %>" aria-describedby="site-title-help">
                        <div class="settings-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="site-title-help">Up to <%= maxLength %> characters.</small>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-form-section" data-settings-item>
            <h3 class="h6" id="organisation-heading">Organisation name</h3>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/organisation" data-editor-label="Organisation name" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="organisation-name">Organisation name</label>
                    <div class="settings-field-actions">
                        <input class="form-control" id="organisation-name" name="organisation_name" type="text" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" required value="<%= organisationName %>" aria-describedby="organisation-help">
                        <div class="settings-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save organisation name</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="organisation-help">Used in the credit and refund guidance. Defaults to Peck'em.</small>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-form-section mb-0" data-settings-item>
            <h3 class="h6" id="site-logo-heading">Logo</h3>
            <% if (hasLogo) { %>
                <div class="border rounded p-3 mb-3 bg-light d-inline-block"><img src="/site-logo?v=<%= Date.now() %>" alt="Current logo" style="height: 3rem; width: auto; max-width: 16rem;"></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <p class="text-muted">No logo set. Only the site title is shown.</p>
            <% } %>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/logo" data-admin-logo data-editor-label="Logo" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="site_logo">Upload a logo</label>
                    <input class="form-control-file" id="site_logo" name="site_logo" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/svg+xml" aria-describedby="site-logo-help" required>
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="site-logo-help">PNG, JPEG, WebP or SVG, up to 512 KB. It appears in the public header and admin navigation bar.</small>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center" style="gap: 0.5rem;">
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                    <% if (hasLogo) { %>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" type="submit" form="remove-site-logo">Remove logo</button>
                    <% } %>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="submit" id="logo-upload">Upload logo</button>
                </div>
            </form>
            <% if (hasLogo) { %>
                <form id="remove-site-logo" method="POST" action="/admin/settings/logo/remove" hidden></form>
            <% } %>
        </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-4 mb-4" aria-labelledby="membership-scheme-heading">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-3" id="membership-scheme-heading">Membership scheme</h2>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/membership-scheme" data-editor-label="Membership scheme" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="membership-scheme">Membership scheme name</label>
                    <div class="settings-field-actions">
                        <input class="form-control" id="membership-scheme" name="membership_scheme" type="text" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" required value="<%= locals.membershipScheme || 'GLL Better Card' %>" aria-describedby="membership-scheme-help">
                        <div class="settings-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save membership scheme</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="membership-scheme-help">Used before "membership number" in My membership. Changing the scheme name does not change saved membership numbers.</small>
                </div>
            </form>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-4 mb-4" aria-labelledby="booking-search-settings-heading">
                <h2 class="h5 mb-3" id="booking-search-settings-heading">Booking search range</h2>
                <% if (locals.bookingSearchError) { %><p class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a whole number of days from 1 to 365.</p><% } %>
                <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/booking-search-days" data-editor-label="Booking search range" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="booking-search-days">Maximum days after the From date</label>
                        <div class="settings-field-actions">
                            <input class="form-control" id="booking-search-days" name="days" type="number" min="1" max="365" step="1" required value="<%= locals.bookingSearchDays || 30 %>" aria-describedby="booking-search-days-help">
                            <div class="settings-actions">
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save booking search range</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <small class="form-text text-muted" id="booking-search-days-help">From defaults to today. To defaults to From plus this many days and can only be shortened, never before From. For example, 30 allows 31 inclusive calendar dates. Larger ranges may increase database work.</small>
                    </div>
                </form>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-4 mb-4" aria-labelledby="credit-request-settings-heading">
            <h2 id="credit-request-settings-heading" class="h5 mb-3">Credit and refund settings</h2>
            <p class="text-muted">Manage bank refunds, account-credit time limits and weather credit auto-approval together. Save each setting separately.</p>
            <div class="admin-form-section" data-credit-settings-item>
            <h3 id="refunds-heading" class="h6">Bank and external refunds</h3>
            <p>Master control overriding all other refund settings, including individual credit eligibility and weather approvals. Disabling blocks new bank refund requests, completion of pending bank refunds and external booking refunds. Account-credit awards and spending are unaffected. Pending requests remain visible but cannot be marked as done while disabled. Bank refund requests cannot be declined. Existing eligibility is preserved if refunds are re-enabled.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/refunds" data-editor-label="Bank and external refunds" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <label for="refunds-enabled">Bank and external refunds</label>
                <div class="settings-field-actions">
                <select class="form-control" id="refunds-enabled" name="enabled">
                    <option value="1" <%= locals.refundsEnabled !== false ? 'selected' : '' %>>Enabled</option>
                    <option value="0" <%= locals.refundsEnabled === false ? 'selected' : '' %>>Disabled</option>
                </select>
                <div class="settings-actions">
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save refunds setting</button>
                </div>
                </div>
            </form>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form-section" data-credit-settings-item>
            <h3 id="request-window" class="h6">Credit request period</h3>
            <p>Bookings older than x days can't be reimbursed.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/credit-request-period" data-editor-label="Credit request period" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <label for="credit-request-days">Number of days</label>
                <div class="settings-field-actions">
                    <input class="form-control" id="credit-request-days" name="days" type="number" min="1" max="365" step="1" required value="<%= creditRequestDays %>">
                    <div class="settings-actions">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save period</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form-section" data-credit-settings-item>
            <h3 id="credit-lifetime-heading" class="h6">Credit lifetime</h3>
            <p>Credits expire after x days, measured from issue time. Changing this does not alter existing expiry dates. Spent or expired credits are hidden and cannot be used at checkout. A bank refund requested before expiry remains available for administrator review.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/credit-lifetime" data-editor-label="Credit lifetime" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <label for="credit-lifetime-days">Credit lifetime in days</label>
                <div class="settings-field-actions">
                    <input class="form-control" id="credit-lifetime-days" name="days" type="number" min="1" max="36500" step="1" required value="<%= creditLifetimeDays %>">
                    <div class="settings-actions">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save credit lifetime</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </form>
            </div>
            <div class="admin-form-section mb-0" data-credit-settings-item>
            <h3 id="auto-approval-heading" class="h6">Weather credit slot auto-approval</h3>
            <p>Allow administrators to approve a time slot across all facilities. Pending and later Weather requests for the exact same start and end time receive credit automatically. The card-paid portion is refundable; reissued credits retain their original refund eligibility. Only Weather requests can be auto-approved. Other requests require individual review; their card-paid portion is non-refundable unless the administrator allows a bank refund.</p>
            <p>Disabling pauses all saved slots without removing them or reversing credits. Re-enabling applies them to new requests; requests submitted while disabled still require review. The slot list uses the Credit request period above.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/credit-slot-auto-approval" data-editor-label="Weather credit slot auto-approval" data-editor-preview="false" data-editor-inline>
                <label for="credit-slot-auto-approval">Auto-approval</label>
                <div class="settings-field-actions">
                <select class="form-control" id="credit-slot-auto-approval" name="enabled">
                    <option value="0" <%= !autoApprovalEnabled ? 'selected' : '' %>>Disabled</option>
                    <option value="1" <%= autoApprovalEnabled ? 'selected' : '' %>>Enabled</option>
                </select>
                <div class="settings-actions">
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-cancel-edit>Cancel</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save auto-approval</button>
                </div>
                </div>
            </form>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>

</html>
